145
00:09:51,650 --> 00:09:55,880
All right, look, I do. I have a little thing for him. Just..
好吧，你說的沒錯 我對他是有點感覺，只是…

146
00:09:56,660 --> 00:09:58,680
- Oh, my God. - It's just physical.
-喔，我的天啊 -是肉慾的

147
00:09:58,860 --> 00:10:03,300
I have it totally under control, okay? It's just when I see them together..
我已經完全控制住了，好嗎？ 只是當我看到他們在一起…

148
00:10:03,500 --> 00:10:06,630
sometimes, I just get a little jealous.
有時候，我就會有點忌妒

149
00:10:06,800 --> 00:10:10,460
Wow. Isn't that ironic that he liked you, and now you like..?
哇，好諷刺喔，他以前喜歡過你 然後現在你喜歡…

150
00:10:10,640 --> 00:10:12,130
I get it!
我知道！

151
00:10:13,410 --> 00:10:15,570
All right, as long as it's under control.
好吧，一切都控制住就好了

152
00:10:15,740 --> 00:10:18,770
You can't do anything about it. He's already dating her.
你不可以採取任何行動 他已經跟她在一起了

153
00:10:18,950 --> 00:10:21,410
She is a nice person. That wouldn't be right.
她是個好人，那是不對的

154
00:10:21,580 --> 00:10:24,110
I know, I know. So it's just not a big deal.
我知道，我知道，所以沒事啦

155
00:10:24,290 --> 00:10:26,550
- So can we keep this between us? -Sure.
-你可以不要說出去嗎？ -當然

156
00:10:26,720 --> 00:10:30,820
Great, because I gotta get out of here. The smell of beets is killing me.
太好了，因為我得出去了 我快被甜菜味熏死了

157
00:10:36,560 --> 00:10:39,930
Any chance Charlie has a deaf twin?
查莉可能會有耳聾的雙胞胎妹妹嗎？

158
00:10:45,310 --> 00:10:46,500
- Hi, honey. - Hey.
-嗨，親愛的 -嘿

159
00:10:46,670 --> 00:10:49,730
I brought a friend home for dinner. This is Zack from work.
我帶個朋友回來吃晚餐 這是我同事柴克

160
00:10:49,910 --> 00:10:53,210
Oh, of course. It's so nice to see you again, Zack.
當然啦，很高興再見到你，柴克

161
00:10:53,380 --> 00:10:56,040
- You too. - You guys haven't actually met before.
-我也是 -你們並沒有見過面

162
00:10:56,220 --> 00:10:58,080
But, boy, you're both polite.
天啊，你們還真有禮貌

163
00:10:58,250 --> 00:11:00,240
Have a seat. I'll get you a beer.
請坐，我幫你拿啤酒

164
00:11:00,420 --> 00:11:01,720
- I got it. - Thanks.
-我來拿 -謝謝

165
00:11:05,260 --> 00:11:09,030
- So Zack's pretty nice, huh? - Yeah, I guess.
-柴克不錯吧？ -是啊，應該吧

166
00:11:09,660 --> 00:11:13,290
So how would you like to have a baby that's half yours and half his?
那你想不想要跟他生個小孩呢？

167
00:11:17,240 --> 00:11:18,300
Excuse me?
什麼？

168
00:11:18,470 --> 00:11:21,930
We're talking about sperm donors, and Zack may be the guy.
我們在講的是精子捐贈者 而柴克或許就是適當的人選

169
00:11:22,110 --> 00:11:27,140
Look. He's intelligent, he's healthy, he's athletic. I mean, he's sperm-tastic!
他很聰明、健康、體格強壯 我是說，他是最佳人選了！

170
00:11:29,280 --> 00:11:33,050
Chandler, this is crazy. Well, what did you even say to him?
錢德，這太瘋狂了 你是怎麼跟他說的？

171
00:11:33,220 --> 00:11:36,520
"Come up. Meet my wife. Give us your sperm."
「上來看看我老婆 給我們你的精子」

172
00:11:37,160 --> 00:11:40,390
I invited him to dinner so you'd get a chance to get to know him.
我邀請他來吃晚餐讓你見見他

173
00:11:40,590 --> 00:11:43,830
With a sperm bank, you never meet the guy, get to check him out.
如果是精子銀行 我們根本不能見到那個捐贈者

174
00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:46,400
- Chandler! - I'm telling you, he's great.
-錢德！ -我告訴你，他棒透了

175
00:11:46,600 --> 00:11:50,730
I mean, even if my sperm worked fine, I think he'd be the way to go.
我是說，即使我的精子沒有問題 我也認為我們應該選擇他

176
00:11:52,170 --> 00:11:54,200
I'm not going to be a part of this.
我不要淌這趟渾水

177
00:11:54,380 --> 00:11:58,710
You can't bring some random guy home and expect him to be our sperm donor.
你不能隨便帶個男的回來 當精子捐贈者

178
00:11:58,880 --> 00:12:00,710
Okay.
好吧

179
00:12:01,920 --> 00:12:03,610
- Zack? - Thanks.
-柴克 -謝謝

180
00:12:04,220 --> 00:12:07,150
Do you have a coaster? I don't want to make a ring.
你有杯墊嗎？我不想留下杯印

181
00:12:07,320 --> 00:12:09,480
Tell me about yourself, Zack.
多聊聊你自己，柴克

182
00:12:12,730 --> 00:12:16,320
Oh, God, do you think she heard? It'd be so bad if she heard.
天啊，你覺得她聽到了嗎？ 如果她聽到就慘了

183
00:12:16,500 --> 00:12:20,560
Maybe she didn't hear. I'll go into that dressing room and talk. You stay here.
或許她沒有聽到，我到隔壁間說話 你待在這裡

184
00:12:20,740 --> 00:12:22,700
- See if you can hear me. - Okay, great.
-看看你是不是可以聽到我說話 -好的

185
00:12:25,610 --> 00:12:28,910
Oh, thank God, I can't hear a word that you're saying.
喔，感謝上帝，我聽不到你說話

186
00:12:29,080 --> 00:12:33,710
- I didn't say anything yet. - Well, get back in there and talk.
-我還沒有開始說話 -那回去裡面然後說話啊

187
00:12:35,050 --> 00:12:36,070
I'm Rachel.
我是瑞秋

188
00:12:36,250 --> 00:12:40,050
It's so annoying when I put Emma on the phone to talk with my friends.
讓艾□在電話上跟我朋友講話 真的很討厭

189
00:12:40,490 --> 00:12:42,180
What?
什麼？

190
00:12:42,360 --> 00:12:45,120
Well, some things are just hard to say to your face.
嗯，有些事是很難當你的面說的

191
00:12:46,590 --> 00:12:50,620
Okay, well, I heard that. Which means that she heard it too.
好吧，我聽到了，表示她也聽到了

192
00:12:51,100 --> 00:12:54,760
- We have a problem. - Oh, what are we gonna do?
-我們有麻煩了 -喔，我們該怎麼辦呢？

193
00:12:54,940 --> 00:12:56,770
Just be honest with her.
就老實跟她說吧

194
00:12:57,200 --> 00:12:58,730
Oh, my God!
喔，我的天啊！

195
00:12:58,910 --> 00:13:01,240
It is annoying when parents put babies on the phone.
父母讓嬰兒聽電話 的確是很討厭

196
00:13:01,410 --> 00:13:03,400
All right, enough out of you!
好了，你說夠了！

197
00:13:06,310 --> 00:13:07,870
Thank you.
謝謝

198
00:13:14,190 --> 00:13:17,890
Where did I go wrong? This is good stuff.
我是哪裡做錯了？這是很好的東西啊

199
00:13:26,070 --> 00:13:29,830
- Hello? - I need to talk to Charlie. Is she there?
-哈囉？ -我要跟查莉講話，她在嗎？

200
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:32,770
No, she went shopping with Rachel. Why? What's up?
不在，她跟瑞秋去逛街了 為什麼？怎麼了？

201
00:13:32,940 --> 00:13:36,900
I'm meeting with Professor Sherman about my being the keynote speaker.
我正在跟薛曼教授 討論關於我當主講人的事

202
00:13:37,080 --> 00:13:39,440
- How's it going? - It could be better.
-進行的如何呢？ -可以更順利的

203
00:13:42,250 --> 00:13:43,740
He fell asleep.
他睡著了

204
00:13:43,920 --> 00:13:46,910
What? But I already bought my ticket to Bermuda!
什麼？但是我已經 訂了到百慕達的機票了！

205
00:13:48,360 --> 00:13:51,120
- Barbados. - Fine, I'll rent a car and drive.
-是巴貝多 -好啦，我再租車開過去

206
00:13:52,860 --> 00:13:54,490
You have to get that job.
你一定要得到這工作

207
00:13:54,660 --> 00:13:56,960
What am I supposed to do? He's out cold.
我應該怎麼辦呢？他完全睡著了

208
00:13:57,130 --> 00:13:59,830
In fact, he was just talking in his sleep before..
事實上，剛剛他還在說夢話

209
00:14:00,000 --> 00:14:04,370
and evidently he wants someone named Fran to "spank him harder."
而且他還要一個叫法蘭的人 「再打用力點」

210
00:14:05,510 --> 00:14:07,840
- Well, just wake him up. - I can't.
-那叫醒他吧 -我不行

211
00:14:08,010 --> 00:14:12,570
If he realizes that I'm the one who put him to sleep, I won't get the job.
如果他發現我是讓他睡著的人 我就得不到這個工作了

212
00:14:12,750 --> 00:14:13,940
That's a tough one.
那倒是挺難的

213
00:14:14,110 --> 00:14:17,140
Oh, wait a minute. This happened to me before.
等等，這以前也發生在我身上過

214
00:14:17,320 --> 00:14:22,550
Yeah, I was auditioning for a play, and the producer fell asleep. I..
是啊，我之前在試演一齣戲劇的時候 那個製作人睡著了，我…

215
00:14:22,720 --> 00:14:24,850
No, wait a minute.
不，等等

216
00:14:25,030 --> 00:14:26,580
It was me who fell asleep.
其實是我睡著了

217
00:14:27,490 --> 00:14:31,660
I mean, hey, Shakespeare, how about a chase scene once in a while?
我是說，莎士比亞 來點動作場面吧？

218
00:14:34,770 --> 00:14:38,330
- Hey, guys, dinner's ready. - I'm gonna go wash up first.
-嘿，晚餐好了 -我先去洗手

219
00:14:38,510 --> 00:14:39,970
Thanks.
謝了

220
00:14:42,610 --> 00:14:47,380
What do you think? I want his genes for my kid. Those eyes, those cheekbones.
你覺得呢？我要我的孩子有他的基因 那雙眼睛，那顴骨

221
00:14:47,780 --> 00:14:51,110
Okay, there's enthusiastic, and there's just plain gay.
好了，可能是過度狂熱 也有可能是同志

222
00:14:53,090 --> 00:14:55,420
- You don't like him. - I think he's fine.
-你不喜歡他 -我想他不錯

223
00:14:55,590 --> 00:14:57,850
But we don't know anything real about him.
但是我們對他瞭解不夠

224
00:14:58,030 --> 00:15:02,360
- I wish we could get more information. - All right, just follow my lead.
-我希望我們可以知道多一點 -好的，跟著我的話鋒轉

225
00:15:03,130 --> 00:15:06,690
- You guys have a great place here. - Thanks. I'm crazy about our place.
-你們家真是好棒 -謝謝，我很喜歡這地方

226
00:15:06,870 --> 00:15:08,630
Hey, speaking of crazy..
嘿，說到瘋狂…

227
00:15:10,270 --> 00:15:13,760
do you have a history of mental illness in the family?
你們家有遺傳性精神疾病嗎？

228
00:15:14,540 --> 00:15:19,310
No. Although, I did have an uncle who voted for Dukakis.
沒有，但是我是有個叔叔 投票給杜凱吉斯

229
00:15:19,910 --> 00:15:22,910
That's really not the kind of thing we're looking for.
那真的不是我們所希望看到的

230
00:15:24,550 --> 00:15:26,520
Okay.
好的

231
00:15:26,820 --> 00:15:29,790
So tell me, how'd you guys meet?
告訴我，你們是怎麼認識的呢？

232
00:15:29,960 --> 00:15:33,260
Oh, friends first, drunk in London, you know the story.
剛開始是朋友，在倫敦喝醉，你知道的

233
00:15:33,430 --> 00:15:35,120
I've got a better question for you:
我有個更棒的問題要問你

234
00:15:35,630 --> 00:15:38,830
Do you or any of your blood relatives have diabetes?
你或是你的血親 有人有糖尿病嗎？

235
00:15:41,100 --> 00:15:42,330
No.
沒有

236
00:15:42,740 --> 00:15:46,300
Heart disease? Alzheimer's? Gout?
心臟病？阿茲海默症？痛風？

237
00:15:48,610 --> 00:15:51,340
You guys don't have people for dinner a lot, huh?
你們不常請朋友到家裡用餐，是嗎？

238
00:15:51,850 --> 00:15:53,900
We're just making conversation.
我們只是在找話題聊聊

239
00:15:54,080 --> 00:15:57,520
Yeah, well, okay. I heard a joke today. It's pretty funny.
好吧，我今天聽到一個笑話 真的是挺好笑的

240
00:15:57,690 --> 00:16:00,450
You know what's not funny? Male pattern baldness.
你知道有什麼是不好笑的嗎？ 雄性禿頭

241
00:16:04,330 --> 00:16:07,820
You guys have shown a lot of interest in me tonight, and I'm flattered..
你們今晚對我很有興趣，我很受寵若驚

242
00:16:08,000 --> 00:16:10,290
and quite frankly, a little frightened.
而且老實說，是有點受驚

243
00:16:10,860 --> 00:16:12,760
Can we just talk about something else?
我們可以聊聊別的話題嗎？

244
00:16:12,930 --> 00:16:14,330
- Sure. - All right.
-當然 -好的

245
00:16:15,140 --> 00:16:16,360
This ravioli's delicious.
這個意大利水餃真是美味

246
00:16:16,600 --> 00:16:20,800
I notice you're enjoying that ravioli with a beautiful set of teeth.
我發現你享用那水餃的牙齒真是整齊

247
00:16:20,980 --> 00:16:22,840
Did you have braces as a child?
你小時候有戴牙套嗎？

248
00:16:23,110 --> 00:16:25,480
- No, I didn't. - Yes!
-不，沒有 -太好了！

249
00:16:28,520 --> 00:16:31,010
We're teeth people, Zack.
我們很重視牙齒的，柴克

250
00:16:36,020 --> 00:16:39,520
Let's just do it. Let's just go over there and see if she heard.
我們過去問她有沒有聽到

251
00:16:39,690 --> 00:16:41,420
- Good plan. - Okay.
-好主意 -好的

252
00:16:41,860 --> 00:16:45,530
- What? Where are you going? - Oh, I'm sorry, Rachel.
-什麼？你是在做什麼呢？ -對不起，瑞秋

253
00:16:45,700 --> 00:16:49,030
I don't have time for your childish games, okay?
我沒有時間玩你的幼稚遊戲，好嗎？

254
00:16:49,200 --> 00:16:51,640
I still have to find something incredible to wear..
我還得要找到很驚艷的衣服穿

255
00:16:51,810 --> 00:16:54,970
so I can beat Mike at "Who's More Over Who"!
那我才可以在「誰先忘了誰」上 打敗麥克！

256
00:17:01,650 --> 00:17:04,080
- Where have you been? - Trying on clothes.
-你好 -你好

257
00:17:01,653 --> 00:17:04,087
-你去哪裡了？ -去試穿衣服

258
00:17:04,250 --> 00:17:09,090
Oh, really? In the dressing room? Well, that's so weird.
真的嗎？在試衣間嗎？喔，真奇怪

259
00:17:09,260 --> 00:17:14,520
Phoebe and I were in the dressing room. Gosh, it's just such a small world.
菲比跟我剛剛也在試衣間 天啊，這世界真是小

260
00:17:14,700 --> 00:17:17,220
Rachel, I heard you two guys whispering.
瑞秋，我聽到你們倆的對談了

261
00:17:17,400 --> 00:17:20,530
Oh, God, you did, you heard. Okay, look, let me explain.
天啊，你聽到了 好的，聽著，讓我解釋

262
00:17:20,700 --> 00:17:22,690
There's nothing to explain. I heard you.
沒有必要解釋，我都聽到了

263
00:17:22,870 --> 00:17:24,860
Phoebe likes Joey.
菲比喜歡喬伊

264
00:17:29,180 --> 00:17:30,870
Yeah.
是啊

265
00:17:32,280 --> 00:17:35,080
I don't understand it. I mean, Phoebe likes Joey..
我不明白，我是說菲比喜歡喬伊

266
00:17:35,250 --> 00:17:38,180
and then she's here to buy a dress to impress another guy?
可是她卻來買衣服 來驚艷另一個男人？

267
00:17:38,350 --> 00:17:43,150
Yeah, that's Phoebe. That's Phoebe. You know, she just wants them all.
是啊，菲比就是那樣，她就是那樣 你知道的，她就是全部都要

268
00:17:43,320 --> 00:17:46,190
It's, like, she's nympho.
那就像是女色情狂

269
00:17:47,730 --> 00:17:49,030
- Wow! - Yeah.
-哇！ -是啊

270
00:17:49,200 --> 00:17:53,030
You know, by the way, I heard you tell her not to do anything.
對了，我有聽到你告訴她 不可以做任何事

271
00:17:53,200 --> 00:17:57,530
Thanks for sticking up for me. God, you are such a nice person.
謝謝你替我說話 天啊，你真是個好人

272
00:17:58,770 --> 00:18:00,760
I try.
我盡量

273
00:18:37,910 --> 00:18:42,970
Oh, my God, you really want me to be the keynote speaker?
我的天啊 你真的要我當主講人嗎？

274
00:18:43,820 --> 00:18:45,610
Thank you!
謝謝你！

275
00:18:47,890 --> 00:18:49,580
You're welcome.
不用客氣

276
00:19:02,270 --> 00:19:04,260
Wow! You look..
哇！你看起來…

277
00:19:05,210 --> 00:19:07,440
stop-eating hot!
真是辣得讓人不想吃東西！

278
00:19:09,010 --> 00:19:11,740
Which is like the highest level of hotness.
這是最高級別的辣耶

279
00:19:11,910 --> 00:19:16,250
Okay, are you sure? Because I am really dreading going to this party.
你確定嗎？ 因為我真的很不想去這派對

280
00:19:16,420 --> 00:19:17,440
Then don't go.
那就別去啊

281
00:19:17,620 --> 00:19:21,350
Mike knows I'm coming. If I don't show up, he'll think it's because of him..
麥克知道我要去，如果我沒出現 他會以為那是因為他…

282
00:19:21,520 --> 00:19:26,320
and then I'm gonna lose face. That's a very serious thing in my culture.
我那樣就會很沒面子 這對我來說是很嚴重的事

283
00:19:27,360 --> 00:19:31,960
All right, then you go to that party, and you pretend to be over Mike.
好吧，那就去派對吧 然後假裝已經完全不受麥克影響

284
00:19:32,130 --> 00:19:35,660
Afterward, you come to my place and I'll get you good and drunk.
之後你再來我家 我再幫你好好借酒解愁

285
00:19:35,840 --> 00:19:37,600
You got it. Okay.
沒問題，好的

286
00:19:37,770 --> 00:19:40,300
But not on the wine that you made, okay?
但是不要喝你自己釀的酒好嗎？

287
00:19:40,470 --> 00:19:44,380
Because I just don't want to go back to the emergency room.
因為我不想要再進急診室了

288
00:19:47,610 --> 00:19:50,450
I'm sorry, I don't seem to have enough cash.
我很抱歉，我沒有足夠的現金

289
00:19:50,950 --> 00:19:52,580
You would accept rubles, would you?
你可以接受盧布不是嗎？

290
00:19:52,750 --> 00:19:57,160
This is a hundred-thousand-ruble note, which is worth approximately..
這是張面額十萬的盧布 大約的價值是…

291
00:19:57,320 --> 00:19:59,090
nothing.
零

292
